# ============================================================
# Docker build context ignore rules
# 加速构建上下文传输，排除不需要的大文件和构建产物
# ============================================================

# --- 构建产物 ---
**/target/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/.tsbuildinfo
**/.vite-temp/

# --- 依赖缓存 ---
**/node_modules/
**/.pnpm-store/

# --- 版本控制 ---
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes
**/.github/

# --- IDE / 编辑器 ---
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.codex/
**/.opencode/
**/*.iml
**/.project
**/.classpath
**/.settings/

# --- 操作系统 ---
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/desktop.ini

# --- 文档 (保留 deploy/README.md) ---
**/*.md
!deploy/README.md

# --- 日志 ---
**/*.log
**/logs/
**/nohup.out

# --- 临时文件 ---
**/*.tmp
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~

# --- 环境变量 (本地) ---
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
deploy/.env

# --- 测试 ---
**/__tests__/
**/*.test.*
**/*.spec.*

# --- Docker 自身 ---
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
**/docker-compose*.yml
!deploy/docker-compose.yml

# --- Maven ---
**/.m2/
**/mvnw
**/.mvn/

# --- 其他 ---
**/*.drawio
# 注意：不排除图片资源，因为前端构建需要 src/assets/ 下的图片
# **/*.png 和 **/*.jpg 已移除
